  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest for People People for Forest</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Component will seek to improve international incentive structures when they directly relate to forest protection in RFN priority countries. Improvement of international structures for forest protection. RFN focuses particularily on intact forest wich are among the most biodiverse areas in the world.</narrative>
  </description>
